  "narrative": [
    "The major requires twelve upper-division courses, comprised of three survey courses and nine elective courses, and proficiency in Modern Hebrew.",
    "No more than two courses may be taken P/NP for the major.",
    "A majority of the courses for the major or minor must be taken at UC San Diego.",
    "Students may test out of all or some of the language requirement.",
    "Substitutions to the above major and minor courses must be approved by the program director.",
    "The page does not state the degree type; BA assumed."
